{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6117","title":"Xiaomi Introduces New-Generation Xiaomi SU7 Series: The Driver's Car for a New Era","desc":"Starting from RMB 219,900, the new-generation Xiaomi SU7 Series delivers comprehensive upgrades across design, performance, intelligence, and safety.","view_cnt":"29642","like_cnt":"2","add_time":"1773923871","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/952_operatorx_operatorx_opx/19/03/2026/ffcacdecf3a09797e88a9d90c9c9316f.jpg"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, CHINA,\u0026nbsp;March 19, 2026 —\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eXiaomi today officially launched the new-generation Xiaomi SU7. Envisioned as\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eThe\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eDriver's Car for a New\u0026nbsp;Era\u003c/strong\u003e, fully electric sedan is available in three models — Standard, Pro, and Max — starting from\u0026nbsp;RMB 219,900, RMB 249,900 and RMB 303,900 respectively. With next-level upgrades across vehicle safety, precision driving dynamics, interaction and connectivity, and premium quality, the new-generation Xiaomi SU7 delivers\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ebetter design, better driving, smarter intelligence, and stronger safety\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;in a dream car worth aspiring to.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/63_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/19/03/2026/0e2460a2b90c61daa973390c87e67558.jpg\" alt=\"A variety of sports cars in different colors are lined up together, with a gradient sky in the background and an empty road surface beneath.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIconic Identity Elevated for Next-Level Refinement for\u0026nbsp;Driver\u0026nbsp;and Family\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3\u003eIconic DNA enhanced with new finishes and expanded personalization options\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbodying a true\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eluxury C-segment sedan\u003c/strong\u003e, the new‑generation Xiaomi SU7 maintains the signature dimensions of the first-gen Xiaomi SU7, measuring\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e5 meters long and 2 meters wide, with a 3-meter wheelbase\u003c/strong\u003e. After two years of refinement, iconic elements such as the waterdrop headlights and halo taillights returns, reinforcing the new generation' s identity as a member of the Xiaomi SU7 family and\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;firmly establishing the unmistakable Xiaomi design language in the world of automotives\u003c/strong\u003e.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMajor exterior upgrades for the new generation are focused on color and details in craftmanship that create a more luxury design while offering more extensive personalization choices.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe new‑generation Xiaomi SU7 remains available in a comprehensive palette of\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003enine exterior color options\u003c/strong\u003e. Four of the original Xiaomi SU7' s most popular finishes — Mineral Gray, Pearl White, Brilliant Magenta, and Radiant Purple — return, plus two popular colors from other Xiaomi models: Obsidian Black, from the Xiaomi SU7 Ultra, and Dawn Pink from the Xiaomi YU7. These are joined by three all‑new colors:\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eCoastal Blue, Blazing\u0026nbsp;Red, and Viridian Green\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCoastal Blue\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;is a refreshing, pure, and distinctly premium shade of blue crafted from blue aluminum flakes and nano pigments.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/36_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/19/03/2026/bfee1c9db8e622d44d38bdd14e3c10bf.png\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBlazing\u0026nbsp;Red\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eis bold and expressive—bringing the Xiaomi SU7' s first true red into life like the fiery glow of daybreak with a unique shimmer that changes as it catches the light, giving the red a vivid, three-dimensional, and energetic presence.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/177_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/19/03/2026/d51f9740eed01024063c7ccf272ee356.png\" alt=\"A red sports car is parked on a flat surface, with a stunning sunset in the background, orange and purple clouds in the sky, and the city lights visible in the distance.\"\u003eDeeper in tone and understated in luxury,\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eViridian Green\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;is enriched with natural malachite pearlescent particles and a bamboo‑charcoal black base layer, creating a graceful transition from deep green to blue‑green depending on the angle of observation, conveying a calm, understated form of luxury.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/629_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/19/03/2026/e95487cd25ad5c43b3bef690e4ed7f54.png\" alt=\"A green sports car is parked on a modern platform by the water, with a tranquil lake surface and distant hills in the background, as the sunset casts a soft glow.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn addition to the new colors, the most visible upgrade to the new‑generation Xiaomi SU7 is the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eall‑new air intake grille design\u003c/strong\u003e. Cleaner and sportier, the new design features an enlarged\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eC‑shaped decorative surround and wider brake‑cooling ducts,\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003ewhile the\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;4D millimeter‑wave radar\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;is now integrated within the grille, enhancing both aerodynamics and intelligent sensing capabilities.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/356_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/19/03/2026/5bde6cbc6f1521a46007ec81899df57c.jpg\" alt=\"The image features the front grille of the Xiaomi SU7, highlighting its new design elements. It includes a cleaner, sportier grille opening and a 4D millimeter-wave radar. The design features a \u0026quot;U\u0026quot;-shaped element, enhancing its aesthetic appeal. The vehicle is shown in a sleek blue color.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSix wheel options\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;are available across the new-generation Xiaomi SU7 lineup, including three all‑new designs that extend the personalization for all styles and tastes. The new wheel options include\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e19\"\u0026nbsp;Diamond Cut Rims, 20\"\u0026nbsp;Blade Rims, and 21\"\u0026nbsp;Forged Dual Plum Blossom Rims.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eAmong these, the 21\" Forged Dual Plum Blossom Rims feature a complex dual‑layer construction that undergoes thirteen hours of precision machining. Using 22 specialized single‑crystal diamond tools, the wheel is continuously milled for six hours to sculpt an intricate dragon‑scale texture, achieving a seamless glossy finish with exceptionally crisp detailing. In addition to these options, classic options including 20\" Plum Blossom Rims, 20\" Mi‑shaped Rims, and 21\" Sport Rims are also available.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/4_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/19/03/2026/b062ee6fb59363dc3080424c61f4ce3e.jpg\" alt=\"The image showcases various wheel options for vehicles, including:\r\n\r\n1. **19\u0026quot; Diamond-cut Wheels**: Long-range tires with Bridgestone TURANZA.\r\n2. **20\u0026quot; Mi-shaped Wheels**: Long-range tires with noise-dampening foam, Michelin Pilot Sport EV.\r\n3. **20\u0026quot; Plum Blossom Wheels**: Similar to the above with Michelin Pilot Sport EV.\r\n4. **20\u0026quot; Blade Wheels**: Sport tires with noise-dampening foam, Michelin Pilot Sport EV.\r\n5. **21\u0026quot; Sport Wheels**: Sport tires with noise-dampening foam, Pirelli P ZERO™ (PZ5).\r\n6. **21\u0026quot; Dual-Layer Forged Plum Blossom Wheels**: Long-range tires with noise-dampening foam, Pirelli P ZERO™ (PZ5).\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eContinuing this premium look, the new-generation Xiaomi SU7 series brings an\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eelectric front trunk\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eto the entire lineup. Featuring a 105‑liter capacity and enough size to accommodate a standard 20\" carry‑on suitcase, the trunk supports eight different opening methods, including via the exterior physical button, the central display, Xiaomi Auto app, Xiaomi Auto app widget, the remote key fob, UWB proximity control, in‑car XiaoAi voice command, and exterior XiaoAi voice command for unparalleled convenience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/670_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/19/03/2026/7208b5aaee23eea0d72e4d82fe3c7570.jpg\" alt=\"A woman is placing a suitcase into the electric front trunk of a blue car, with the background displaying the interior of the trunk, which contains a suitcase and several small items. The text mentions \u0026quot;105L\u0026quot; and \u0026quot;Electric front trunk.\u0026quot;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eInterior design undergoes major refresh for elevated sophistication and comfort\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe new‑generation Xiaomi SU7 features comprehensive upgrades to its interior design that create refined luxury from the moment you enter the cabin. The cabin itself has undergone a full redesign, brought to reality through premium materials and meticulous workmanship. With a level of\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ecomfort above its class\u003c/strong\u003e, the car offers major upgrades across interior color schemes, ambient lighting, and seat comfort, fully redefining the cabin's premium experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThis luxe interior is available in four color options — the classic Twilight Red and Mist Purple, and the all-new\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eMidnight Black and Cream Beige\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eInterior detailing has also been further refined. On the central console, an\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eall-new symmetrical layout\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;has been adopted to improve visibility and operational convenience for both the driver and front passenger. In terms of materials,\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ealmost 100% of all high-frequency contact surfaces\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;have also been wrapped in soft-touch finishes, while the steering is finished in\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eNappa leather\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;and accented with\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003echrome trim\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003efor enhanced luxury.\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eJewel‑like high‑gloss electroplated buttons electroplated buttons further elevate both tactile feedback and visual sophistication, and\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eluxury quilting\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;is applied to the door panels and seats, complemented by metal nameplates and metal speaker grilles for more exquisite expressions of craftsmanship.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor lighting, the\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;wraparound ambient lighting\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;is the longest in its class at\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e3,636 mm\u003c/strong\u003e. Extending from the central console to the rear row, it now forms a complete band of light encircling the cockpit. The lighting system itself has also been upgraded to a\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003etriple‑layer\u0026nbsp;design\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003ecomposed of\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003edirect and indirect lighting\u003c/strong\u003e: direct light outlines the cabin's contours, while indirect light creates an immersive ambience. With support for split-tone upper/lower settings, real-time synchronization with music and drive modes, and the addition of a door‑open warning function, the new lighting combines personal expression with practicality wrapped in the epitome of luxury and refinement.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/622_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/19/03/2026/b6dc83e5a005b81e19898940a86a1cd3.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSport meets comfort with new interior refinements you can feel\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eFurther elevating both\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eluxury and comfort\u003c/strong\u003e, the new‑generation Xiaomi SU7 also features comprehensive upgrades in\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eseat design and overall interior quality\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/477_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/19/03/2026/e4aee51044a4de20938c3588342c4615.jpg\" alt=\"Driver's sport seat featuring 18-way adjustment options. Adjustments include backrest angle, seat height, cushion tilt, and power lumbar support. New features include cushion length and side bolster adjustments, with upgraded backrest side bolsters.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe front seats now feature a dual‑style design\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;with\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ethree major improvements\u003c/strong\u003e. Seat ventilation and heating is now provided as standard across the line up. The driver' s seat is now 18‑way power‑adjustable with newly added cushion extension, active side bolsters, and cushion side bolsters, complemented by a 60 mm power‑extendable leg rest. The front passenger seat is also available with a new optional 123° zero‑gravity configuration with a dedicated massage mode optimized for recline for balanced full‑body support.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe rear seats\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;also receive\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003efour key upgrades\u003c/strong\u003e. Longer and thicker cushion side bolsters for enhanced lateral support; an additional 20 mm of seat foam; an optimized recline angle of up to 121° for a more relaxed posture that reduces fatigue; and widened, concave sleep-optimized headrests on both sides to securely support the head, ensuring greater stability and sleep quality during long journeys.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn terms of interior experience, the new-generation Xiaomi SU7 features segment's most extensive premium upholstered surfaces, with nearly 100% of high-frequency surfaces wrapped in soft materials. All materials are certified to the highest-grade\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eOEKO-TEX® Standard 100\u003c/strong\u003e, ensuring a safe and comfortable environment for all passengers, including pregnant women and children.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/897_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/19/03/2026/7d100fad16c8648ea124d4e109ae9328.jpg\" alt=\"Interior of a vehicle featuring high-contact surfaces with a soft-touch wrap. The seats are designed with a sleek, modern look, showcasing a light color scheme and detailed stitching. A certification logo indicates the material is safe for contact with infants under three years old.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe cabin has also been comprehensively upgraded.\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eAcoustic laminated glass is now standard across all four doors\u003c/strong\u003e, enhancing overall sound insulation, while the new-generation Xiaomi SU7 Max introduces an\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eUltra-Quiet Cabin\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;with noise and vibration reduction. Through the use of PVB acoustic laminated glass in both the windshield and panoramic roof and additional high-density soundproofing materials throughout the cabin, overall noise reduction\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;is improved by over 4\u0026nbsp;dB\u003c/strong\u003e, bringing cabin quietness to the level of D-segment luxury sedans.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHeat insulation and sun protection\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;are significantly improved too. All new-generation Xiaomi SU7 models come with a\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003etriple-silver coated windshields\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;and\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;double-silver coated roof glass as standard\u003c/strong\u003e, while side windows feature heat-insulating acoustic laminated glass for enhanced protection against both heat and sunlight. On top of these standard features, Xiaomi SU7 Max debuts a\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003enew dual-zone silent\u0026nbsp;EC\u0026nbsp;dimming roof\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;that allows independent brightness control between front and rear within two minutes. With faster response and greater flexibility, the upgraded roof allows front and rear passengers to set their own balances of shade and visibility.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe onboard refrigerator has been upgraded to a\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;drawer-style unit with an independent compressor\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;that enables faster cooling. The independent compressor also supports three adjustable modes — Silent, Standard, and Performance — while offering a wider temperature range, improved stability, and faster cooling.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/574_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/19/03/2026/076edef31c3bbd06f6cdafc473663a88.jpg\" alt=\"An upgraded in-car smart refrigerator with an independent compressor is shown. It features a wider temperature range for cooling and heating, faster cooling capabilities, and lower energy consumption. The design accommodates up to six standard cans and includes an anti-roll feature. A graph illustrates its efficiency compared to a first-generation model.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe in-cabin sensory experience has also been overhauled with two new major upgrades. In collaboration with premium fragrance brand\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eDOCUMENTS\u003c/strong\u003e, three exclusive new scents have been crafted for use with the in-car fragrance system.\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eWoodland Bloom\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;blends floral and woody notes for moments of earthly calm;\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eAlpine Breeze\u003c/strong\u003ecombines fir wood with aquatic mineral tones for a cool and composed refresh; and\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eCedar Mist\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;recreates the natural scent of deep cedar forests.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNew\u0026nbsp;Xiaomi\u0026nbsp;Smart Chassis 2.0: Comprehensive upgrades across core electric systems for precise, composed driving and a up to 902 km max range\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eThe\u0026nbsp;V6s Plus motor comes to the entire\u0026nbsp;Xiaomi\u0026nbsp;SU7\u0026nbsp;lineup alongside an upgraded high-voltage\u0026nbsp;platform, delivering faster acceleration, lower energy consumption, quicker charging, and a range of up to\u0026nbsp;902 km (CLTC)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe new-generation Xiaomi SU7 pushes performance further, with comprehensive upgrades across the entire powertrain.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAt the heart of this blistering performance, the entire lineup is equipped with the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi\u0026nbsp;HyperEngine V6s Plus\u003c/strong\u003e. With a maximum rotational speed of\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e22,000\u0026nbsp;rpm\u003c/strong\u003e, it powers the car from 0–100 km/h in as little as\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e3.08 seconds\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;and to a top speed of\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e265 km/h\u003c/strong\u003e, marking a major breakthrough in high-performance electric drive.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRange is also class-leading thanks to\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eCTB\u0026nbsp;(Cell-to-Body) integrated battery technology\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;across the series with a pack volumetric energy density of up to\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e83.9%\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;that boosts energy capacity without increasing volume. This enables a CLTC range of\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e720 km\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;on the Standard model,\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e902 km\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;on the Pro, and\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e835 km\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eon the Max.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFurther improvements to energy efficiency come courtesy of upgraded energy flow management that increases the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ebattery-to-wheel energy transfer efficiency\u0026nbsp;to 94%\u003c/strong\u003e, with combined consumption as low as\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e11.7 kWh/100 km\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;for highly efficient energy utilization.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eUltra-fast charging has also been upgraded, delivering up to\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e670 km\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eof CLTC range\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;in 15 minutes\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;and charging from 10–80% SoC as quick as 12 minutes with a peak charging rate of\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e5.2C.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eNew Xiaomi Smart Chassis 2.0 achieves leap in hardware, software, and intelligence to reinforce driving dynamics and safety\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe new-generation Xiaomi SU7 continues\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi's commitment to setting the benchmark in its class\u003c/strong\u003e, introducing an all-new Xiaomi Smart Chassis 2.0 with\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003ebreakthroughs across hardware, software, intelligence, and real-world driving experience.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOffering one of the best configurations in the RMB 300,000 segment, the Xiaomi\u0026nbsp;Smart Chassis 2.0\u0026nbsp;features a\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003edouble wishbone front and five-link independent rear suspension\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eacross all models. The chassis automatically detects road conditions and actively adjusts the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eclosed dual-chamber air\u0026nbsp;spring\u0026nbsp;system\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;continuous\u0026nbsp;damper\u0026nbsp;control\u0026nbsp;(CDC®)\u003c/strong\u003eto absorb impacts and increase damping to stabilize the body for notable improvements in ride comfort. The system also supports variable suspension adjustment with location memory that automatically raises and lowers suspension based on GPS location for improved rides in variable terrain.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/688_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/19/03/2026/685e3d717b6a0d913479f6e85bca1f15.jpg\" alt=\"The image features a detailed view of a closed dual-chamber air spring system alongside a continuous damper control mechanism. It highlights the four-stage height adjustment capability and a maximum stiffness variance of 42%. The visual includes mechanical components like a Brembo brake caliper, showcasing advanced automotive engineering.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi\u0026nbsp;Smart Chassis 2.0\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;also offers three suspension modes — Comfort, Sport, and Sport+ — with independently adjustable stiffness for instant response to road conditions. Multi-mode tuning expands the chassis bandwidth, delivering both dynamic performance and daily comfort. Suspension height is also adjustable across four levels from\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e-20 mm to +30 mm (50 mm total)\u003c/strong\u003e, allowing for improved clearance on rough roads and better aerodynamics and reduced drag on flat surfaces.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn the software side, the new-generation Xiaomi SU7 enhances steering performance through refined system tuning. Reduced steering friction allows for a smoother ride, while the 12.5:1 steering ratio — lower than the typical 15:1 in family cars — ensures a quicker, more direct response. At 11.4 m, the turning diameter also stands above the segment average of 12 m, enabling tighter U-turns and other maneuvers perfect for urban driving. Even multi-lane maneuvers can be completed in a single, fluid motion, with smooth and precise control throughout.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe upgraded breaking system now includes four-piston fixed front calipers across the lineup, maintaining consistent performance through\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e40 consecutive 100–0 km/h stops without fade\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e(on the Max version). Both Standard and Pro models have enlarged NAO brake pads with a\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e30% larger\u0026nbsp;contact\u0026nbsp;surface area\u003c/strong\u003e, offering improved quiet and comfort, while the Max model uses low-metallic brake pads for higher heat resistance and durability. Brake feel on all three models are tuned to match the Xiaomi SU7 Ultra, delivering faster responses, stronger feedback, and improved pedal precision. Complemented by 265 mm wide rear tires across the range, the vehicle delivers significantly enhanced stability and grip.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBringing further enhancements to the driving experience, Xiaomi\u0026nbsp;Smart Chassis 2.0's\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eWet Road\u0026nbsp;AI\u0026nbsp;Detection \u003c/strong\u003etechnology has been updated to include an automatically-enabled enhanced stability control mode. Using multi-source data from rain sensors, external temperature sensors, microphones, and cameras, the system analyzes the environment in real-time to accurately judge road grip. Upon detecting wet surfaces, the system prompts the driver to switch to\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eWet Mode\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;via a quick-access shortcut, which then automatically manages AWD torque distribution (on the Max version) and limits regenerative braking intensity. This process operates seamlessly without intrusive pop-ups, ensuring a smoother and safer experience. Moreover, Xiaomi's proprietary collaborative anti-slip control system reduces wheel slip up to\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e40%\u003c/strong\u003e, with a fourfold increase in reaction speed for reactions in just\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e0.35\u0026nbsp;seconds\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTo reduce risks associated with vehicle sharing or valet use, Xiaomi SU7 also introduces an\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eOwner Management Mode\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;accessible via the central display or Xiaomi Auto app. Through the new mode, owners can perform functions like\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003elimiting power output\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eacross all drive modes while still enabling core functionalities, enabling\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eone-tap toggle for high-performance features\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;like Boost, Launch Control, specialized tuning to mitigate risks from accidental operation, and the ability to set flexible\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003espeed limits\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;to ensure the vehicle remains in a safe and controllable state at all times.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe system also incorporates the same\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eMotion Sickness Relief Mode\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;as Xiaomi YU7. Through coordinated optimization of power response and regenerative braking strategies, Motion Sickness Relief Mode significantly enhances acceleration and deceleration smoothness, helping to significantly reduce the likelihood of motion sickness and improve ride comfort and safety.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntelligent, Thoughtful, and Engaging: Assisted Driving Upgraded to XLA Architecture for Safer and Smoother Driving and Parking\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAll-new Four-in-One Domain Control Module for a more powerful intelligent platform\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe new-generation Xiaomi SU7 achieves more advanced intelligence with an integrated \u003cstrong\u003eFour-in-One\u0026nbsp;Domain Control Module\u003c/strong\u003e. More compact and lightweight, the controller enables end-to-end optimizations to energy efficient while being built to durability standards more than twice the industry average. Inside, it integrates two flagship 4 nm chips — the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eSnapdragon® 8 Gen 3\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;handles cabin computing while the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eNVIDIA\u0026nbsp;DRIVE AGX™\u0026nbsp;Thor\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eruns assisted driving. Cutting-edge protocols, including\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eUWB\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eand\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;Wi-Fi\u0026nbsp;7\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eare also supported for improved connection stability, while\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eSentry Mode\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;boasts a large 40% increase in energy efficiency.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eMore thoughtful smart cabin\u0026nbsp;with\u0026nbsp;Xiaomi HyperAI\u0026nbsp;enriches multi-scenario experience\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith the introduction of the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi\u0026nbsp;HyperOS-powered Smart Cabin\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eas standard, the new-generation Xiaomi SU7 redefines the smart cabin experience across the lineup. The upgraded system includes an updated\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003erear\u0026nbsp;remote\u0026nbsp;control\u0026nbsp;panel\u003c/strong\u003e, enabling a more seamless user experience across all\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003esix in-car screens.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eThis is complemented by a more advanced infotainment system and full compatibility with\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi 'Human x Car x Home' smart ecosystem\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdditional upgrades further support greater plug-and-play convenience with external devices: Both driver and passenger sides now feature 1/4‑inch thread mounts with\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eautomotive-grade 27W power delivery\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eto support high‑power devices. An interface beneath the interior rearview mirror is expandable with an optional\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e4K\u0026nbsp;gimbal camera\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;or\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eAI\u0026nbsp;spatial interaction sensor\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;to enhance autonomous perception. Magnetic ecosystem accessories such as wireless charging phone mounts, can be placed around the central display for easier operation. In addition, nine new magnetic points have been added throughout the cabin, all fully compatible with existing Xiaomi YU7 magnetic accessories, enabling seamless cross-model ecosystem integration.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi\u0026nbsp;Hyper XiaoAi\u0026nbsp;AI\u0026nbsp;Voice Assistant\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003ehas also undergone a major overhaul with the addition of a new companion chat mode for\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003emore natural, intuitive interaction\u003c/strong\u003e. The assistant now includes long-term conversation memory that remembers beyond single sessions, as well as extend scenario coverage and real-time web search. Updates to\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003evoice navigation\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;improve\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;understanding of vague or complex instructions\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;and allow for multiple rounds of conversation, enabling drivers to easily plan routes and adjustments waypoints with greater accuracy and flexibility.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe voice assistant can now\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eperform tasks across multiple apps\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;with a single command, leveraging its understanding of on-screen content to execute actions across popular in-car and phone apps. Its\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003evisual understanding\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;also enables recognition of vehicles, buildings, road signs, and common plants and animals, making interactions faster and more intuitive. Exterior XiaoAi\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003evoice control further combines voiceprint recognition with advanced ASR models to accurately identify owners' commands. The system can\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003elisten for the owner's commands\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;without repeated wake-ups, filter out surrounding noise, and allow interaction from any position — creating a more natural, convenient, and secure in-car experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe new cabin is purpose-designed to be more engaging for both drivers and passengers.\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eNew virtual interactive companions let passengers select from five animals to accompany them for the ride. Supporting voice interaction and personalization, the companions can also be used in tandem with\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003etwo magnetic physical plushies\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;that use NFC to integrate with the vehicle system.\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eDynamic Photos\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;capture has also been added to the\u0026nbsp;car\u0026nbsp;cameras, expanding the range of shooting angles and improving content quality to help capture every moment on the road in stunning detail.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/537_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/19/03/2026/443996c4002ee8560dac1cf175904fef.jpg\" alt=\"Magnetic plushies featuring Yingying (an otter) and Huajuan (a Devon Rex cat) are displayed in a car's interior. The text highlights built-in NFC technology that allows users to change themes with a swipe.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFull upgrades to\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi\u0026nbsp;HyperTask\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;include support for more than\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e40 new atomic capabilities\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;and seamless integration with smartphones while leveraging in- and out-of-car sensing to create and execute tasks automatically. The task management system has been optimized for more efficient and convenient operation. The Discover page interface has been refreshed with a more flexible new feature recommendation mechanism, and task popularity and reference counts are now displayed, helping new users quickly identify trending tasks and providing greater emotional engagement.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOther upgrades to\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003evehicle intelligence\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;include:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAn all-new urban navigation system supports full-scenario lane-level navigation and display of landmarks and real-time traffic events in 3D for improved intuition and usability.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe customizable HUD navigation (the new-generation Xiaomi SU7 Max only) includes\u0026nbsp;Immersive, Combined and Persistent modes\u0026nbsp;for more accurate and immersive navigation.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eA new\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eTransparency Mode\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;enhances safety during low-speed driving and reversing, using omnidirectional sound penetration to enable communication between the interior and exterior without opening windows. The mode also provides 3D position alerts that can accurately identify hazard directions, effectively improving car and pedestrian safety.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe upgraded\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eoff-board security protection\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eincludes a reconstructed vehicle vibration detection algorithm that identifies abnormal vibrations with 100% accuracy. Sentry Mode adds real-time Exterior XiaoAi voice alerts, high-risk event playback and intelligent annotation review to protect the vehicle when parked and unattended.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAssisted driving with 360° perception and faster response now standard on all models\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eFeatured as standard across the new-generation Xiaomi SU7 lineup is the NVIDIA DRIVE AGX Thor™ in-vehicle computing platform. With up to 700 TOPS of computing power, the platform delivers a 37.8% increase in power over the previous generation, while the Blackwell architecture enhances parallel computing performance and deep learning capabilities. With support for higher-speed data transmission, more connectivity options, and a high-performance DDR cache, the system delivers significantly improved response speeds and efficiency.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFeeding into this system, the updated sensor suite features LiDAR, a 4D millimeter-wave radar, eleven high-definition cameras, and twelve ultrasonic radars, enabling higher perception coverage and faster, more reliable assisted driving performance across virtually all scenarios.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerception is further improved by upgraded\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eALD-coated ultra-transparent\u0026nbsp;anti-glare\u0026nbsp;cameras\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;that reduce the effects of daytime backlight and nighttime glare to improve image capture accuracy and overall system stability.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAll models come with front and rear camera dirt detection as standard. Linked to the assisted driving system, the detection model compares consecutive frames captured by the camera to quickly identify dirt and runs\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;an automatic 2.5 bar high-pressure wash\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;for class-leading cleaning.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/527_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/19/03/2026/47c0540c337d63c7c831a37a69b30dbb.jpg\" alt=\"The image features a promotional design for the \u0026quot;Camera Auto-Cleaning\u0026quot; feature in the new Xiaomi SU7. It highlights the front and rear surround-view cameras with a focus on dirt detection and automatic high-pressure cleaning, emphasizing clearer forward blind-spot visibility. The technical specifications for nozzle pressure (2.5 Bar) and spray flow (104 mL/10s) are also included.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eXiaomi Assisted Driving upgraded with XLA Architecture\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe new XLA Architecture marks a major upgrade of Xiaomi's assisted driving architecture, evolving from \"imitating humans\" to \"truly understanding the world\".\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt on the\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eXiaomi\u0026nbsp;MiMo-Embodied\u0026nbsp;foundation model\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e— the first base model to unify cognition across assisted driving and embodied robotics — Xiaomi XLA enables bidirectional knowledge transfer between the two domains. The model integrates multi-modal and multi-embodied data to enhance general understanding, strengthening performance in spatial perception, spatial reasoning, and physical-world comprehension. To ensure coverage of rare events, the XLA architecture moves beyond the limitations of traditional data-driven imitation learning, enabling contextual understanding and reasoning. It can infer and respond to corner cases, empowering the system to progressively develop human-like decision-making capabilities.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePowered by Xiaomi MiMo-Embodied model, Xiaomi XLA introduces\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003evoice-controlled\u0026nbsp;assisted\u0026nbsp;driving\u003c/strong\u003e, allowing users to perform lane changes, adjust speed, and modify following distance via voice commands. With enhanced understanding of complex environments, the system supports defensive driving through real-time risk prediction and proactive response, identifying potential hazards in advance and improving overall driving safety. A new\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003evoice parking feature\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;is also introduced, enabling users to set parking styles through in-car voice commands or initiate parking directly through exterior voice interaction. The XLA architecture also achieves\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eparking spot-level navigation\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003ein commercial parking garages for the first time in the industry, enabling precise routing to specific destinations such as elevators and charging stations, completely redefining the standard for smart parking.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSetting a New Benchmark in Safety for Confidence in Every Journey\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3\u003eEnhanced safety with 2,200 MPa ultra-high strength steel, upgraded protection and new escape design\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eContinuing Xiaomi's uncompromising commitment to safety, the new-generation Xiaomi SU7 continues to be developed to the highest industry standards, exceeding both C-NCAP and C-IASI\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003esafety ratings and undergoing full-scenario, all-seat crash testing with female dummies.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/15_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/19/03/2026/629f4d6dfaf503e5ee3910e88336de4e.jpg\" alt=\"The image presents a detailed diagram of an \u0026quot;Armor-Cage Steel-Aluminum Hybrid Body Structure\u0026quot; for a vehicle. Key features include:\r\n\r\n- **Maximum Strength**: 2200 MPa\r\n- **High-Strength Steel \u0026amp; Aluminum Alloy Ratio**: 90.3%\r\n- **Vehicle Torsional Rigidity**: 51,000 N·m/deg\r\n\r\nIt highlights various structural components like ultra-high-strength front longitudinal beams, a triangular beam with integrated die-cast aluminum, and details on crash resistance and material types, including submarine-grade ultra-high-strength steel.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi's proprietary\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e2,200 MPa ultra-high strength steel\u0026nbsp;and aluminum alloy\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eaccounts for\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e90.3%\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eof the body structure across the full lineup, significantly enhancing structural safety, while key structural upgrades further improve body safety performance. Using hot gas forming technology, the high-strength steel has been molded to form an\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003enew integrated roll cage\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;from the A-pillar to the C-pillar. At 2,200 MPa, the steel features\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e40% greater tensile strength compared with 1,500\u0026nbsp;MPa\u0026nbsp;materials\u003c/strong\u003e, providing better resistance to deformation in extreme events such as underride collisions and rollovers. On the sides, newly added 2,200 MPa ultra-high strength steel four-door impact beams increase load-bearing capacity by over\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e28%\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003ecompared with 1,500 MPa materials, effectively reducing cabin intrusion during side impacts and improving occupant protection.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/882_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/19/03/2026/e1dece43d66e5c0f3a56003bfd61e292.jpg\" alt=\"The image illustrates a vehicle's structure emphasizing its 2200MPa ultra-high-strength steel components. Key features include a 2.56m \u0026quot;Embedded Roll Cage\u0026quot; enhancing safety by minimizing risks of A-pillar fractures and roof intrusions, along with improved four-door anti-collision beams that significantly boost impact resistance and energy absorption compared to standard models.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRear passenger safety is also comprehensively upgraded, with\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e9 airbags\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;included as standard across the lineup for enhanced rear-passenger safety in side-impact scenarios and broader overall accident coverage.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn addition, the full lineup features an integrated mechanical cable mechanism for the door handles and dedicated backup power supply that is fully compliant with upcoming 2027 Chinese national safety standards. Even in extreme cases where the 12V battery is disconnected after a collision, doors can still be unlocked from both sides, allowing occupants to exit the vehicle safely.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eFull battery protection, engineered for every journey\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eDrawing on Xiaomi’s world-leading in-house battery pack development and manufacturing, the new-generation Xiaomi SU7 features\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;enhanced structural safety\u003c/strong\u003e, with full physical protection of the battery pack covering the top, sides, and underside to ensure structural integrity under extreme impacts and complex road conditions.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAll models come with 1,500 MPa anti-scratch crossbeams and Xiaomi SU7 Ultra's \"bulletproof coating\" as standard, delivering enhanced resistance to abrasion and puncture, and significantly improving safety on complex terrains.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe battery system also meets the industry's highest standards for thermal management, ensuring no permeation, no fire, and no explosion, even if a single cell undergoes thermal runaway at full charge.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn top of this, the full lineup is equipped with an\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eASIL-D rated battery system\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003ethat can perform an emergency power cutoff within 4ms, supported by a 24-hour vehicle-to-cloud monitoring system for continuous safety alerts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTo further ensure safety, the battery pack has undergone some of the most rigorous safety testing, with the battery exceeding national standard requirements in\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003e96% of all 1,231 test items\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAmong the twenty-four tests defined by the latest Chinese national standards, the new-generation Xiaomi SU7 meets validation criteria significantly beyond regulatory requirements in eleven tests.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eEnhanced safety for owners\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eTo reduce risks associated with vehicle sharing or valet use, Xiaomi SU7 also introduces an\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eOwner Management Mode \u003c/strong\u003eaccessible via the central display or Xiaomi Auto app. Through the new mode, owners can perform functions like\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003elimiting power output\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003eacross all drive modes while still enabling core functionalities, enabling\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eone-tap toggle for high-performance features\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;like Boost, Launch Control, specialized tuning to mitigate risks from accidental operation, and the ability to set flexible\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003espeed limits\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;to ensure the vehicle remains in a safe and controllable state at all times.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(36, 91, 219);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrice and Availability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe new-generation Xiaomi SU7 is launched in Standard, Pro, and Max, prices starting from\u0026nbsp;RMB 219,900, RMB 249,900, RMB 303,900 respectively.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAfter two years of meticulous development, the new-generation Xiaomi SU7 offers improved design, driving experience, intelligence, and safety. Pre-orders are now available via the Xiaomi Auto WeChat Mini Program and Xiaomi Auto App.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eProduct images and videos available here: \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://miretail.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/InternationalPRRepository/IgCiZf8v2SygQp3qI1yrWJh9Af8Qp3InSGlM76QelSbEkyc?e=L0MEUV\"\u003eNew-generation Xiaomi SU7 Series\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e*Xiaomi SU7 Series is not for sale outside of Chinese Mainland. For promotional purposes only.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Xiaomi Corporation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi Corporation was founded in April 2010 and listed on the Main Board of the Hong Kong Stock Exchange on July 9, 2018 (1810.HK). Xiaomi is a consumer electronics and smart manufacturing company with smartphones and smart hardware connected by an IoT platform at its core.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmbracing our vision of “Make friends with users and be the coolest company in the users’ hearts”, Xiaomi continuously pursues innovations, high-quality user experience and operational efficiency. The Company relentlessly builds amazing products with honest prices to let everyone in the world enjoy a better life through innovative technology.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is one of the world’s leading smartphone companies. In September 2025, the MAU reached approximately 741.7 million (including smartphones and tablets) globally. The Company has also established the world’s leading consumer AIoT (AI+IoT) platform, reached approximately 1,035.5 million smart devices connected to its platform (excluding smartphones, laptops and tablets) as of September 30, 2025. In October 2023, Xiaomi upgraded its strategy to “Human × Car × Home” smart ecosystem, seamlessly merges personal devices, smart home products, and cars. Xiaomi always centers on humanity and is committed to providing comprehensive, better connected experiences. Xiaomi products are present in more than 100 countries and regions around the world. In July 2025, Xiaomi was included in the Fortune Global 500 list for the seventh year in a row, ranking 297th.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eXiaomi is a constituent of the Hang Seng Index, Hang Seng China Enterprises Index, Hang Seng TECH Index and Hang Seng China 50 Index.\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"379","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1774496649"},"common":null}